      "text": [
        "5888 - وَ قَالَ نَبِيُّ اَللَّهِ صَلَّى اَللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهِ : \"بَادِرُوا إِلَى رِيَاضِ اَلْجَنَّةِ \" قَالُوا يَا رَسُولَ اَللَّهِ وَ مَا رِيَاضُ اَلْجَنَّةِ قَالَ \"حَلَقُ اَلذِّكْرِ \"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.5888 - The Prophet of Allah (swt), peace be upon him and his family, said:\n\"Hasten towards the gardens of Paradise.\"\nThey asked: \"O' Messenger of Allah (swt), what are the gardens of Paradise?\"\nProphet (sw) replied: \"The gatherings of remembrance (of Allah (swt)).\""
        ]
      }
